{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6f5fc5820fcfb7e365f6f6651f147779a0127fca2b92bd2e0db9566aafc4e3ef", "ja": "小悪魔の手応え♡", "zh": "小恶魔的成果♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b291f16470de1c01853855d98fd394d446d8b7f48d898b14451ae8cb682ab971", "ja": "二人だけでグラビア撮影に来た伊織と真。そ\nの出来に手応えを感じる一方、明日に控えた\n雪歩の撮影が気になる。雪歩はまだ自信が持\nてない様子。だが、今まで頑張ってきた雪歩\nならきっと大丈夫だと、二人は感じていた。", "zh": "伊织和真两人单独前去拍摄写真照。\n两人对拍摄结果很有信心，但同时也很在意\n明天雪步的拍摄状况会怎么样。\n雪步似乎还是没什么自信，不过两人认为\n一路努力过来的雪步一定没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7adfbd71b29c100bc4427cc4f65b21be78daf709e8a20fcf8935ebc95e90f4c2", "ja": "（そして数日後。真と伊織の二人だけで、\nCM用グラビア撮影をすることになった）", "zh": "（几天后，真和伊织两人单独前去\n拍摄广告用的写真照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7de86d0993017a78440ec63cc542cf3380fd6668a5c4462c71046679c2d7d42c", "ja": "（俺も他の現場があって同行できないけど、二人は\nどんな写真を撮ってもらっているのかな……）", "zh": "（我因为有其他行程而无法陪同，\n不知道两人拍得怎么样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebea99436663892fbbe5054ac16107568081496ca276b8b386defa370a1f2ddd", "ja": "ボク、本当に……カワイイですか？　イヤ、\nこのままで。ボクを見つめたままで、言ってください。", "zh": "在下真的……很可爱吗？\n不，请你就这样看着在下的眼睛对在下说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "f1918a76d3415b2ce35914179df440143311ebbdc9d580d8bd52b0661d5ba011", "ja": "私が呼んだらすぐに来てね？　遅れたりしたら……\nつねっちゃうわよ♪　えいえいっ♪", "zh": "我一呼唤，你就要马上出现喔？\n要是来晚了……就等着被我捏吧♪嘿、嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1004_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "38ab6f8ce7b9c1ec441402df14f34cc7165ca55949a55c1cdeb30498f7134b55", "ja": "はーい。OKです！\n雰囲気出てて、いい感じでしたよ～。", "zh": "好，OK！\n气氛有带出来，感觉很棒喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "864f879692bc1c8031c0173a9a4e1e98376edef306b4e685fec0535807c8b5ba", "ja": "……はぁ～。", "zh": "……呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "864f879692bc1c8031c0173a9a4e1e98376edef306b4e685fec0535807c8b5ba", "ja": "……はぁ～。", "zh": "……呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "5928832652cf721ba42cb42c4ba455dbd4c6b46f3b4667294172563abd9c0fb5", "ja": "あ～、緊張した～っ！　無理しないで甘えるのって、\nホント恥ずかしくて……あれでよかったのかな？", "zh": "啊～紧张死了～！要撒娇又要表现得自然，\n真的很让人害羞……刚刚那样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "9e5ff7b993f4ea187db1b58ed387f46a5cf473c37f7d9e5ee04bd2bca64a6b1e", "ja": "よかったんじゃない？\nスタッフにも好評だったし♪", "zh": "应该没问题吧？\n工作人员也一致好评呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "264a360f273dab4ddfdab5588c3685a552fa8dfedb7d327a7435c14f1bf1b9fd", "ja": "ホント？　へへっ、恥ずかしかったけど、じつはボクも\n手応えがあったんだ！　目覚めたっていうかな……。", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，虽然很害羞，\n但在下其实还挺得心应手的！该说是觉醒了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "b1fac9721982787c56e6808f9abfbe5abd669777dd87d0753607edb4250cb3db", "ja": "うん、これぞまさに『少女、開花』！！　だよねっ♪", "zh": "嗯，这正是『少女，开花』！！对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "12df2f75a026753127652f2a027e6953536c301d521fc3dc4f654a70666919af", "ja": "私は開花っていうより進化って感じだわ♪\n伊織ちゃんの可愛さに、限界はないのよね～。", "zh": "我的表现与其说是开花，更像是进化呢♪\n伊织的可爱是没有极限的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "afa6fd4d08b7db4a1ab416098fd40d4f93818064ea5878cd83ac72139181a03b", "ja": "うん、今回のユニット、本当に面白いよね。\nテーマが刺激的なせいか、いろんな発見があってさ。", "zh": "嗯，这次的新团体真的很有趣。\n不知道是不是因为主题充满刺激性，有许多新收获呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "5fed19db4bc8e1ae64836a527f78fccbfff6cbcdfff69e0971d99372e640eae9", "ja": "ってまあ、じつは発見なんてなくても、ボクはこんなに\n女の子できるってだけで、十分なんだけどっ♪", "zh": "不过就算没有收获，在下光是发现自己能够\n表现得这么像女孩子，就已经很满足了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "e2fcb5cc52aaa2cbb2d19279b007e3f962b72b966ee4720313f9c6e5b0181f75", "ja": "なに言ってるのよ。TVのCMもあるし、お披露目公演\n美希と雪歩の撮影も残ってるわ。まだまだこれからよ！", "zh": "你在说什么啊，接下来还有电视广告、首次亮相公演，\n美希和雪步也还没拍写真照，一切才刚开始呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "1a396fafc9108c3dc7a22e2f785f51f00224f8cf956fd06e1185153ba0d5ed1e", "ja": "わかってるって。美希と雪歩の撮影は明日だったよね。\n……明日かあ……。", "zh": "在下知道啦。美希和雪步是明天才要拍摄吧？\n……明天啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e432753e1485c60d578ce3a6d6c036fb689c67a42e98cf31aec4a6ce3645595", "ja": "……雪歩は、昨日のレッスンの感じだと、\nまだちょっと自信なさそうだったわね？", "zh": "……看昨天训练课程的情况，\n雪步她好像还是有点缺乏自信呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "2ef6cd0075dd07abb87ba3f35fb80c253fb1f44c9e751010a76f87c44235b3ac", "ja": "うん。師匠達のアドバイスで、\nかなり励まされてはいたんだけど。", "zh": "嗯，虽然师父们的建议给了她很大的鼓励……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0c50056d917db48234ff889462cd23b40a3cdb77404a626946052167c454f75", "ja": "これで大丈夫っていうところまでは、\n思えてないのかな……。そっか。明日か～。", "zh": "但或许还没到让她觉得自己没问题的地步吧……\n啊～就是明天啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "82a93cb57faac25ecc6e8160c4e13d553d08b1e831c4b726a1004bcea87a4184", "ja": "……ま、なんとかなるんじゃない？", "zh": "……不过，总会有办法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "3b440f6c467cda385d5cbee2ffcf2309698415c428b873c621c3c63e1a42de0e", "ja": "……伊織はそう思うんだ？", "zh": "……伊织是这么想的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "af65622a4f7a86975cd16b8bf8a18cd1674d0263a1ea70a24a107af2c4cb73f4", "ja": "ええ、思うわ。だって雪歩、泣いてばっかりだったり、\n逃げようとしたり、たまに本気で逃げたりするけど。", "zh": "对啊，我是这么想的。\n雪步虽然爱哭又总是想逃避，偶尔也会真的逃避……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "f5bf7937cec29c4d8ec8d08eede3d9fbd32190a67e86eff898d9ff190ecf897e", "ja": "今もちゃんと、私達と一緒にいるんだもの。\nホント、あきれちゃうわよね。", "zh": "但她现在也还好好地和我们一起前进啊。\n真是让人不知道该说什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "a5dc1dcbfc8899cece17bb8329118b80c3d37b02ef852c7f80ac69c318b27107", "ja": "……そっか。そうだよね。", "zh": "……这样啊，说得也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "967219ef26d7baf2dc5cca3f87a5deda9cff3df61c4237d7789ab8731490a37f", "ja": "それに考えてみれば、明日は美希もいるし。\n{$P$}もいるもんね！", "zh": "而且仔细想想，明天还有美希在。\n加上{$P$}也在嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "4cb890c28227c41a282a3dd642b0cf0bf8dee687cf4c3a4d00813f8bdced5aea", "ja": "そうよ。美希も{$P$}も、\nいっつも最後に、いいところを持っていくんだから。", "zh": "就是啊，美希也好、{$P$}也罢，\n每次到了最后好处都会被他们占走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "4ded0eab1cf28398382408b7377fe4e9b9c161362e21c219dff7c81d8bd43091", "ja": "あはは、そうかも。\n美希も、さらっといいこと言ったりするし。", "zh": "啊哈哈，好像是耶。\n美希也常会随口说出一些动听的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "4f3840e9cd761f37559f2cbc36013fc0f0ea516b55a4907a93f2ac6ef731c6fa", "ja": "普段はフワフワしてるくせに。\nそういうところがニガテなのよねー。", "zh": "明明平时总是一副飘飘然的样子，\n我实在拿她这点很没辙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "8ee55f7fbe05d3a1ce298d57e9369f9e346859f7a7e38f9cacb5b891ae689516", "ja": "そうなの？\nでも、美希は伊織のこと好きみたいだけど。", "zh": "是吗？\n但美希好像很喜欢伊织耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "50032dbe6be8cac515a26422f02dbfd8171733a3231667fae3174ae7704bfee7", "ja": "だから、そういうところもニガテなのっ！", "zh": "她这点也一样让我没辙啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1030_se", "source_sha256": "38c1bd24a0f12389251e4fef0af059f703923695084acf329de5fe987ebfcd22", "ja": "ピローン♪", "zh": "叮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "ff9f84e00cf1f3a0a9d68a6145a1d890562e7c2b8ef9add288c15ed9b908f4ed", "ja": "ん？　携帯にメール……。", "zh": "嗯？手机收到了简讯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "c3803d1d13dbee43e2463ebc9a8b2627731d471c882cc9652bee39535389a8b7", "ja": "{$P$}からだ。\n『撮影、問題なさそうか？』だって。", "zh": "是{$P$}传来的。\n他问说『拍摄没问题吗？』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_05_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "ddc8c076284d85cf06cdbc5629ebe69c76a703d92d7074903e0260e2c597bace", "ja": "私にも来たわ。……それじゃ、\n『大ありよ！』って返事しちゃいましょ♪", "zh": "我也收到了。\n……回复他『大有问题！』吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
